  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Leila mini crossbody is the small bag that solves a lot of problems. Crafted in pebbled leather with a magnetic snap closure, it has exterior flap and zip pockets that keep everything within reach—plus a phone pocket. (Very necessary.) The adjustable strap means you can wear it long or short, day or night. You'll forget you're carrying it.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Argento hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior zip pocket, interior slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Flap Closure With Magnetic Snap</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.9&quot; (L) x 5&quot; (H) x 2.80&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
